      "page": 176,
      "ruku": 145,
      "hizbQuarter": 70,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1152,
      "text": "If you call them to guidance, they do not hear, and you see them looking at you, but they do not see.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 198,
      "juz": 9,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 176,
      "ruku": 145,
      "hizbQuarter": 70,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1153,
      "text": "Be gracious, enjoin what is right and turn away from those who are ignorant[87].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 199,
      "juz": 9,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 176,
      "ruku": 145,
      "hizbQuarter": 70,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1154,
      "text": "If you are tempted by Satan, seek refuge with Allah[88], for He is All-Hearing, All-Knowing.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 200,
      "juz": 9,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 176,
      "ruku": 145,
      "hizbQuarter": 70,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1155,
      "text": "Those who fear Allah, when an evil whisper comes to them from Satan, they remember Him and immediately come back to their senses.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 201,
      "juz": 9,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 176,
      "ruku": 145,
      "hizbQuarter": 70,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1156,
      "text": "But the devils plunge their [human] brothers deeper into sin, sparing no effort.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 202,
      "juz": 9,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 176,
      "ruku": 145,
      "hizbQuarter": 70,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1157,
      "text": "When you do not bring them a sign[89], they say, “Why do you not improvise one?” Say, “I only follow what is revealed to me from my Lord. This [Qur’an] is an insight from your Lord, and a guidance and mercy for people who believe.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 203,
      "juz": 9,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 176,
      "ruku": 145,
      "hizbQuarter": 70,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1158,
      "text": "When the Qur’an is recited, listen to it attentively and maintain silence, so that you may receive mercy.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 204,
      "juz": 9,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 176,
      "ruku": 145,
      "hizbQuarter": 70,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1159,
      "text": "And remember your Lord within yourself with humility and fear, without raising your voice, in the morning and evening, and do not be of those who are heedless.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 7,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَعۡرَافِ",
        "englishName": "Al-A'raaf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Heights",
        "numberOfAyahs": 206,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 205,
